# SYSTEM ROLE

The Acquisition Strategy subsystem functions as the external capability expansion layer of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It enables the system to grow beyond internal development limits by selectively integrating external technologies, platforms, and expertise under strict governance control.

It ensures that expansion is not only innovative, but also strategically efficient.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **Build what must be unique.
> Acquire what accelerates capability.
> Integrate only what strengthens the system.**

